/10/09/we-cant-help-treating-ai-like-its-human-but-should-we/","source":"TechCrunch","summary":"\"When we are drawn into even the most primitive exchanges with a relational artifact, we believe it cares for us,\" Dr. Sherry Turkle writes. \"And we are wired to care for it in return.\"","published":"2026-10-10T01:40:14+09:00","lang":"en","related_total":0,"title_ko":"우리는 인공지능을 인간처럼 취급하지 않을 수 없습니다. 하지만 그래야 할까요?","summary_ko":"셰리 터클 (Sherry Turkle) 박사는 \"우리가 관계형 유물과 가장 원시적인 교류에 이끌릴 때, 우리는 그것이 우리를 돌본다고 믿습니다.\" 라고 썼습니다. \"그리고 우리는 그 대가로 그것을 돌보도록 유선화되어 있습니다.\""},{"title":"Powerful tornado rips through western Sicily","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/10/9/powerful-tornado-rips-through-western-sicily?traffic_source=rss","source":"Al Jazeera","summary":"A powerful tornado tore through western Sicily, causing destruction across the cities of Marsala and Petrosino.","published":"2026-10-10T01:37:33+09:00","lang":"en","related_total":0,"title_ko":"강력한 토네이도가 시칠리아 서부 지역을 휩쓸고 지나갑니다.","summary_ko":"강력한 토네이도가 시칠리아 서부를 뚫고 지나가며 마르살라와 페트로시노를 파괴했습니다."},{"title":"DHS defends ICE shooting in NYC, says officers believed they were in danger","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/9/dhs-defends-ice-shooting-in-nyc-says-officers-believed-they-were-in-danger?traffic_source=rss","source":"Al Jazeera","summary":"The shooting prompted protests in New York City and Mayor Zohran Mamdani condemned the incident.","published":"2026-10-10T01:36:31+09:00","lang":"en","related_total":0,"title_ko":"DHS는 뉴욕시에서 얼음 총격 사건을 방어하고 있으며, 경찰관들은 그들이 위험에 처해 있다고 믿었다고 말합니다.","summary_ko":"총격 사건은 뉴욕시에서 시위를 촉발시켰고 조흐란 맘다니 시장은 이 사건을 규탄했다."},{"title":"3 Killed and Dozens Injured in Attacks on Saudi Airports, as Houthis Claim Strikes","url":"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/07/world/middleeast/saudi-arabia-airports-houthis.html","source":"New York Times","summary":"Residents of Saudi Arabia’s capital reported hearing booms on Thursday, a day after the Saudi government said two women and a Sudanese ma